# Optional: enables higher-quality AI image generation via OpenAI's Images API
# (DALL-E 3) for each day's travel photo.
#
# Without this key, WanderTale automatically falls back to Pollinations.ai —
# a free, keyless image-generation service — so real photos are generated
# either way. The app never shows a fake or placeholder image as if it were
# real.
#
# To enable the OpenAI tier:
#   1. Get a key at https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
#   2. Copy this file to ".env" in the project root
#   3. Paste your key below (billed per image by OpenAI — see their pricing)
#   4. Restart `npm run dev`
#
# This key is read only on the server (inside vite-plugins/imageApiPlugin.ts)
# and is never sent to or bundled into the browser.
OPENAI_API_KEY=
